    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91460" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκτ-εύω</span></b> , 
			Boeot.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουκτ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>box, spar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				4.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				4.40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὕτω πυκτεύω ὡς οὐκ ἀέρα δέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
					9.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ παγκρατιάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					456d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τεοῦς Ἑρμᾶς ποτ᾽ Ἄρευα π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corinn.
					11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς σὸν κρᾶτα π.</span>
			<i>strike with the fist</i> on the head, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				229
			</span></i>: generally, <i>fight</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξιφήρη π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					10.31
				</span></i>
			; of gladiators, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Arch.</u>
				30(1929).24
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>):—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπύκτευται αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
